                "height": 4,
                "widget": {
                    "title": "\ud83d\udcca Daily & Hourly Token Consumption Breakdown",
                    "sectionHeader": {
                        "subtitle": "Stacked daily totals and intraday 1-hour generation rates broken down by token billing type",
